        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo DS-234, Brushed Stainless Steel Deadbolt Strike Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Stainless Steel Strike Plate is great for use with <a href=\"/collections/deadbolts\"><b>deadbolts</b></a>. It measures 1-1/8 inches x 2-3/4 inches. Package includes deadbolt strike plate with installation screws for use on either wood or metal doors and frames. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-DS-234-specifications.gif?v=1704354587\" width=\"347\" height=\"207\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo DS-234 Replacement Deadbolt Strike\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo DS-234 Replacement Deadbolt Strike:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>18 gauge</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Brushed Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Screws: #8-32 x 3/4\" Flat Head Combo Screws (for wood or metal doors)</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DS-234.pdf?v=1704262315\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo DS-234 Deadbolt Strike Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
